### Base URL for all requests (IIE, 2026).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Register a sensor — POST JSON (Microsoft Docs, 2026).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sensors/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01",
  "location": "Room 4, Zone B",
  "category": "Environmental"
}

### 2. Send moisture telemetry (float — Generics demo) (IIE, 2026).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/moisture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:01",
  "sensorType": "SoilMoisture",
  "value": 15.5,
  "unit": "%"
}

### 3. Send power telemetry (int — Generics demo) (IIE, 2026).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/power
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "METER_01",
  "sensorType": "Wattage",
  "value": 620,
  "unit": "W"
}

### 4. Send valve telemetry (bool — Generics demo) (IIE, 2026).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/valve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "VALVE_01",
  "sensorType": "ValveState",
  "value": true,
  "unit": ""
}

### 5. Validate deployment tree (Recursion demo) (IIE, 2026).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deployment/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Facility A",
  "nodeType": "Facility",
  "isConfigured": true,
  "children": [
    {
      "name": "Zone 1",
      "nodeType": "Zone",
      "isConfigured": true,
      "children": [
        {
          "name": "Sub-Zone B",
          "nodeType": "Sub-Zone",
          "isConfigured": true,
          "children": [
            { "name": "Sensor M-01", "nodeType": "Sensor", "isConfigured": true, "children": [] },
            { "name": "Sensor M-02", "nodeType": "Sensor", "isConfigured": false, "children": [] }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Operator overloading demo (IIE, 2026).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/operator-overloading

### 7. Dashboard summary (IIE, 2026).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary

